<title>POLAND: WEDEL MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 2.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.21 vs   6.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.44 vs   4.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.21 vs   4.13</p>
<p> Sales		   59.57 vs  57.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.83 vs   3.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.46 vs   6.70</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.19 vs   5.05</p>
<p> Sales		  176.09 vs 152.01</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Wedel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
